<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="page-hero__eyebrow">Governance</div>
    <h1>Board of Directors</h1><p class="page-hero__sub">Volunteers who oversee strategy, finances, and accountability.</p></div></section>
    <section class="wrap" style="padding:48px 0;max-width:1080px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:20px">
      <article class="portrait-card"><div class="portrait-card__avatar" style="background-image:url('once-upon-a-time-assets/portraits/patricia.png')"></div><h2 class="portrait-card__name">Yasmine Rodriguez</h2><p class="portrait-card__role">Executive Director</p><p class="portrait-card__bio">Former director of education at the Queens Museum.</p></article><article class="portrait-card"><div class="portrait-card__avatar" style="background-image:url('once-upon-a-time-assets/portraits/mary.png')"></div><h2 class="portrait-card__name">Maria Rodriguez</h2><p class="portrait-card__role">Board Chair</p><p class="portrait-card__bio">Community organizer and founding board member.</p></article><article class="portrait-card"><div class="portrait-card__avatar" style="background-image:url('once-upon-a-time-assets/portraits/natalie.png')"></div><h2 class="portrait-card__name">Dr. James Chen</h2><p class="portrait-card__role">Vice Chair</p><p class="portrait-card__bio">Pediatric health practice in Forest Hills.</p></article><article class="portrait-card"><div class="portrait-card__avatar" style="background-image:url('once-upon-a-time-assets/portraits/faith.png')"></div><h2 class="portrait-card__name">Sarah Thompson</h2><p class="portrait-card__role">Treasurer</p><p class="portrait-card__bio">CFO at a mid-stage tech company; oversees financial controls.</p></article><article class="portrait-card"><div class="portrait-card__avatar" style="background-image:url('once-upon-a-time-assets/portraits/jane.png')"></div><h2 class="portrait-card__name">Lena Stuart</h2><p class="portrait-card__role">Secretary</p><p class="portrait-card__bio">Long-time volunteer; documents board and committee work.</p></article><article class="portrait-card"><div class="portrait-card__avatar" style="background-image:url('once-upon-a-time-assets/portraits/bella.png')"></div><h2 class="portrait-card__name">Patricia Henley</h2><p class="portrait-card__role">Director</p><p class="portrait-card__bio">Arts patron; represents the donor community.</p></article><article class="portrait-card"><div class="portrait-card__avatar" style="background-image:url('once-upon-a-time-assets/portraits/mariah.png')"></div><h2 class="portrait-card__name">Mary Henderson</h2><p class="portrait-card__role">Director</p><p class="portrait-card__bio">Educator; chairs the Programs committee.</p></article><article class="portrait-card"><div class="portrait-card__avatar" style="background-image:url('once-upon-a-time-assets/portraits/josh.png')"></div><h2 class="portrait-card__name">Patrick Diaz</h2><p class="portrait-card__role">Director</p><p class="portrait-card__bio">Local business owner; advises on community partnerships.</p></article>
    </section>
    <section class="wrap" style="padding:48px 0;max-width:880px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-muted);line-height:1.7">
      <h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:22px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--pillar)">Board policies</h2>
